{"id":"ec861937e87884c02d0417a6853b1181b5b45ee1","url":"https://television.run/","title":"Television","site_name":"Buzzing","source":"television.run","byline":null,"excerpt":"Television is a visual interface for personal agents, a space for creating, arranging, and reusing artifacts.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\">\n    <main>\n      \n      <div>\n        <p><img src=\"/assets/tv-icon.animated-bars-BqSJfqod.svg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <p>The missing GUI for personal agents.</p>\n        <p>\n          Television gives you and your agent a visual space for creating and\n          working with artifacts.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      \n      \n    </main>\n\n    <section data-logo-marquee=\"\">\n      <div>\n        <h2>Works with any agent harness.</h2>\n        <p>\n          If your agent can run commands and write files, it can use\n          Television.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div data-logo-marquee-track=\"\" aria-label=\"Supported agent harnesses\">\n        <p><img src=\"/assets/claude-code-B0eQV0yf.png\" alt=\"Claude Code\"></p>\n        <p><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"Pi\"></p>\n        <p><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"Hermes\"></p>\n        <p><img src=\"/assets/codex-CCJVxETe.png\" alt=\"Codex\"></p>\n        <p><img src=\"/assets/openclaw-C-fSUT-g.png\" alt=\"OpenClaw\"></p>\n        <p><img src=\"/assets/claude-code-B0eQV0yf.png\" alt=\"Claude Code\"></p>\n        <p><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"Pi\"></p>\n        <p><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"Hermes\"></p>\n        <p><img src=\"/assets/codex-CCJVxETe.png\" alt=\"Codex\"></p>\n        <p><img src=\"/assets/openclaw-C-fSUT-g.png\" alt=\"OpenClaw\"></p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n      <div>\n        <h2> Artifacts</h2>\n        <p>\n          Artifacts let your agent pin important information in Television instead\n          of losing it in chat.\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          They can be simple cards, interactive views, or external web pages\n          that you revisit and organize over time.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div aria-label=\"Stack of example artifacts\" data-scale-height=\"500\" data-scale-width=\"560\" data-scale-graphic=\"\" data-scale-graphic-inner=\"\">\n          <article>\n            \n            <p><span>Today</span></p>\n          </article>\n          <article>\n            \n            <p><span>Status card</span></p>\n          </article>\n          <article>\n            \n            <p><span>Website checklist</span></p>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n      <screen-diagram></screen-diagram>\n      <div>\n        <h2> Channels</h2>\n        <p>\n          Organize your artifacts into channels: persistent spaces where you and\n          your agent can collect, arrange, and return to the things you’re\n          working on.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div>\n        <h2> Skills</h2>\n        <p>\n          Supercharge your agent with skills: reusable instructions for\n          creating beautiful interfaces that you can adapt and share.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n    \n  </DIV>","content_text":"The missing GUI for personal agents. Television gives you and your agent a visual space for creating and working with artifacts. Works with any agent harness. If your agent can run commands and write files, it can use Television. Artifacts Artifacts let your agent pin important information in Television instead of losing it in chat. They can be simple cards, interactive views, or external web pages that you revisit and organize over time. Today Status card Website checklist Channels Organize your artifacts into channels: persistent spaces where you and your agent can collect, arrange, and return to the things you’re working on. Skills Supercharge your agent with skills: reusable instructions for creating beautiful interfaces that you can adapt and share.","fetched_at":"2026-10-03T12:15:09.006Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<p>The missing GUI for personal agents.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"The missing GUI for personal agents.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n          Television gives you and your agent a visual space for creating and\n          working with artifacts.\n        </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Television gives you and your agent a visual space for creating and working with artifacts.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2>Works with any agent harness.</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Works with any agent harness.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n          If your agent can run commands and write files, it can use\n          Television.\n        </p>","sentences":[{"en":"If your agent can run commands and write files, it can use Television.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2> Artifacts</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Artifacts","zh":"文物"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n          Artifacts let your agent pin important information in Television instead\n          of losing it in chat.\n        </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Artifacts let your agent pin important information in Television instead of losing it in chat.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n          They can be simple cards, interactive views, or external web pages\n          that you revisit and organize over time.\n        </p>","sentences":[{"en":"They can be simple cards, interactive views, or external web pages that you revisit and organize over time.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>Today</span></p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><span>Status card</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Status card","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>Website checklist</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Website checklist","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2> Channels</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Channels","zh":"渠道"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n          Organize your artifacts into channels: persistent spaces where you and\n          your agent can collect, arrange, and return to the things you’re\n    