rc=\"/assets/openclaw-C-fSUT-g.png\" alt=\"OpenClaw\"></p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n      <div>\n        <h2>文物</h2>\n        <p>Artifacts let your agent pin important information in Television instead of losing it in chat.</p>\n        <p>They can be simple cards, interactive views, or external web pages that you revisit and organize over time.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div aria-label=\"Stack of example artifacts\" data-scale-height=\"500\" data-scale-width=\"560\" data-scale-graphic=\"\" data-scale-graphic-inner=\"\">\n          <article>\n            \n            <p><span>Today</span></p>\n          </article>\n          <article>\n            \n            <p>Status card</p>\n          </article>\n          <article>\n            \n            <p>Website checklist</p>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n      <screen-diagram></screen-diagram>\n      <div>\n        <h2>渠道</h2>\n        <p>Organize your artifacts into channels: persistent spaces where you and your agent can collect, arrange, and return to the things you’re working on.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div>\n        <h2>技能</h2>\n        <p>Supercharge your agent with skills: reusable instructions for creating beautiful interfaces that you can adapt and share.</p>\n      </div>\n\n    \n  </div>"}